              "op": "add",
              "text": "",
              "kind": "prose"
            },
            {
              "op": "add",
              "text": "CopilotKit registers the element, renders it in place of the node, and assigns",
              "kind": "prose"
            },
            {
              "op": "add",
              "text": "the node's A2UI `ComponentContext` to its `context` property on every update.",
              "kind": "prose"
            },
            {
              "op": "add",
              "text": "The element reads its props and writes to the data model through that context,",
              "kind": "prose"
            },
            {
              "op": "add",
              "text": "for example with web_core's `GenericBinder`. Elements render in the browser",
              "kind": "prose"
            },
